WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
There was no broken glass in the film. That was the point.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers changed one verb in a question about a traffic accident.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later, more people in one wording group reported glass that never appeared.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A suggestive question can influence an answer. It does not prove mind control.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The same caution matters when a product promises a new brain state.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Check the evidence. Check the actual offer. Decide for yourself.
